docs {
  `https://api.orienteering.services` — the endpoints LiveOL migrates to.

  Every read returns an `ETag` and `cache-control: public, max-age=5` behind
  CloudFront, and honours `If-None-Match` with a 304. The documented contract is at
  most one poll per 10 s per endpoint, always conditional.
}
